<Grid
  xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
  xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
<Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
    </Grid.RowDefinitions>
    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="10"/>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
	<TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}">
		WORD ON THE WATERFRONT
		<LineBreak/>
		STRAIT OF MALACCA
	</TextBlock>

    <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="FM"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="FREE SEAS SYNDICATE"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="TO"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="RANSOM FLOTILLA"/>
	<TextBlock Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="INFO"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}">
		ALL CREWS
	</TextBlock>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="7" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="SUBJ"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="7" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="THE BIG ONE - SAG IN THE CHANNEL, FRIGATE IN THE ANCHORAGE"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="9" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" TextWrapping="Wrap">
		1. The Strait of Malacca - the richest, narrowest hunting ground in Asia. A full anti-piracy SAG works the channel: a Knox, two ex-South Vietnamese Barnegats, a Pegasus and a Blackwood, with air cover from the local base.
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		2. Our backers have delivered an Alvand frigate to the hidden anchorage. Buy her, bring her - she outguns everything else we own, and you will need her where we are going.
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		3. Take the merchants, break the SAG, and the strait is ours.
	  </TextBlock>
</Grid>
